Script behavior:
- read queries.json
- for each: GET https://export.arxiv.org/api/query?search_query=<urlencoded>&start=0&max_results=N&sortBy=relevance (default) or submittedDate for discovery queries. Add `sort` field in query spec.
- Save raw to raw/<key>.xml
- Parse Atom entries: id, title, summary, published, updated, authors, journal_ref, doi, comment, primary_category.
- Select best by normalized token overlap between expected_title and entry title (Jaccard on lowercased alphanumeric tokens, ignoring stopwords), requiring >= threshold (0.55 default). If no entry meets threshold → selected=null, status "unmatched".
- Write `sources.json`: {"generated_at","api_endpoint","queries":[...], "sources":[{key, query, sort, fetched_at, http_status, selected: {...}, candidates:[{arxiv_id,title,overlap}]}]}
- Print compact table.

